#: ../../integration_guides/Backups/cohesity.rst:2
msgid "Cohesity"
msgstr "Cohesity"

#: ../../integration_guides/Backups/cohesity.rst:4
msgid ""
"|morpheus| integrates with Cohesity for selection as a Cloud backup "
"target for compatible Cloud types and for adding Cohesity S3 storage "
"servers and storage buckets. |morpheus| integrates with your existing "
"Cohesity appliance, which can then be set as the default backup solution "
"for any existing Clouds. From there, easily schedule backup routines "
"during Instance provisioning and restore Instances when needed. To "
"utilize storage features, integrate a Cohesity S3 storage server and then"
" create a Cohesity S3 storage bucket."
msgstr ""
"|morpheus| integrates con Cohesity para selection as un Cloud backup "
"destino para compatible Cloud types y para adding Cohesity S3 storage "
"servers y storage buckets. |morpheus| integrates con your existente "
"Cohesity appliance, cual puede entonces be set as el predeterminado "
"backup solution para cualquier existente Clouds. Desde elre, easily "
"schedule backup routines durante Instance provisioning y restore "
"Instances cuando needed. To utilize storage características, integrate un"
" Cohesity S3 storage server y entonces create un Cohesity S3 storage "
"bucket."

#: ../../integration_guides/Backups/cohesity.rst:6
msgid ""
"This section discusses the process for integrating Cohesity with "
"|morpheus|, setting backup options during Instance provisioning, "
"restoring Instances from Cohesity backup, and using Cohesity S3 storage."
msgstr ""
"This sección discusses el proceso para integrating Cohesity con "
"|morpheus|, setting backup opciones durante Instance provisioning, "
"restoring Instances desde Cohesity backup, y using Cohesity S3 storage."

#: ../../integration_guides/Backups/cohesity.rst:9
msgid "Adding the integration"
msgstr "Agregar integration"

#: ../../integration_guides/Backups/cohesity.rst:11
msgid ""
"Cohesity integrations are added in the backup integrations area of the UI"
" (|BacInt|). If a Cohesity integration is not an option, you must "
"download and add the Cohesity plugin to the |morpheus| appliance. For "
"additional information on adding a plugin, including how to access the "
"|hpe|-maintained repository which includes the Cohesity plugin, see the "
"`plugin section "
"<https://docs.morpheusdata.com/en/latest/administration/integrations/integrations.html#plugins>`_"
" of this documentation."
msgstr ""
"Cohesity integrations son agregado in el backup integrations area of el "
"UI (|BacInt|). If un Cohesity integration no es un opción, you debe "
"download y add el Cohesity plugin to el |morpheus| appliance. Para "
"información adicional on adding un plugin, including how to acceso el "
"|hpe|-maintained repository cual includes el Cohesity plugin, see el "
"`plugin section "
"<https://docs.morpheusdata.com/en/latest/administration/integrations/integrations.html#plugins>`_"
" of este documentación."

#: ../../integration_guides/Backups/cohesity.rst:13
msgid ""
"With the Cohesity plugin installed, navigate to |BacInt| to add a new "
"Cohesity integration. Click :guilabel:`+ ADD` and a modal appears for "
"creating a new Cohesity backup provider."
msgstr ""
"With el Cohesity plugin instalado, navigate to |BacInt| to add un nuevo "
"Cohesity integration. Click :guilabel:`+ AGREGAR` y un modal appears para"
" creating un nuevo Cohesity backup proveedor."

