#: ../../integration_guides/Backups/cohesity.rst:31
msgid "Setting the Cloud Backup Provider"
msgstr "Setting el Cloud Backup Provider"

#: ../../integration_guides/Backups/cohesity.rst:33
msgid ""
"Now that the Cohesity backup provider is created, it can be set as the "
"default backup provider for supported Cloud types. To set this "
"configuration on a Cloud, navigate to the Clouds list page (|InfClo|) and"
" edit a compatible Cloud (|pencil| icon). Expand the \"Advanced Options\""
" section and locate the BACKUP PROVIDER configuration. Set the Cohesity "
"provider as the backup provider for the Cloud and click :guilabel:`SAVE "
"CHANGES`."
msgstr ""
"Now que el Cohesity backup proveedor es creado, it se puede establecer as"
" el predeterminado backup proveedor para compatible Cloud types. To set "
"este configuración on un Cloud, navigate to el Clouds página de lista "
"(|InfClo|) y edit un compatible Cloud (|pencil| icon). Expand el "
"\"Advanced Options\" sección y locate el BACKUP PROVIDER configuración. "
"Establezca el Cohesity proveedor as el backup proveedor para el Cloud y "
"click :guilabel:`GUARDAR CHANGES`."

